The MIT license covers the code written for this project. It does not cover
third-party assets or the trademarks and likenesses of the people and
businesses these experiences honor. The full list, with the details, is in
the "License, credits, and trademarks" section of README.md. In short:

- www/lib/three.min.js is by the Three.js Authors and keeps its own license.
- The Earth Defense planet and moon textures are by Solar System Scope, used
  under CC BY 4.0. See www/earthdefense/assets/CREDITS.md.
- The Interstate Tire, Seed to Seed, Sunnyvale Jenn Consulting, and The Auto
  Man names, logos, and related graphics belong to their owners and appear
  here by permission, as part of tribute experiences. Photographs of the
  people these experiences honor belong to them as well.

Most of that artwork is kept out of this repository through .gitignore. ONE
TRADEMARK IS PRESENT IN THE SOURCE: John Walker's three-blade W. It is drawn
as inline SVG path data in www/automan/index.html, again as the standalone
www/automan/favicon.svg, and again on the social card at
www/automan/assets/og-automan.webp. It is geometry rather than a loaded image,
so it cannot be withheld. Copying this project's code does not grant any right
to that mark. Please do not reuse it.

Photographs of the people these experiences honor are never included here.
